**DIRAC
.TITLE
 O atom
.WAVE F
.ANALYZE
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
.X2C
.PRINT
1
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.SCF
*SCF
# 1s(2) 2s(2) 2p_12(2)
.CLOSED SHELL
4 2
# 2p_32(2)
.OPEN SHELL
1
2/0,4
# Activate level shift for open-shell orbitals to achieve convergence
# This is to increase the gap between the closed-shell 2p- and open-shell 2p+
# orbitals, which are almost degenerate
.OLEVEL
0.1 
.EVCCNV
1.0D-9  1.0D-7
.PRINT
0
**ANALYZE
.MULPOP
*MULPOP
# 2 fermion symmetries
.VECPOP
 all
 all
.PRINT
0
*END OF
